  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2102.14 License-exempt work",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.14 “License-exempt work” means asbestos disposal site work that can be performed, pursuant to Env-A 1811.03, by an individual or entity that is not a licensed ADS contractor.\n\nSource. #12605, eff 9-1-18",
